tate":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-08-25T20:07:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-09T21:18:47Z","closed_at":"2025-09-09T20:50:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Engine Version: 4.5.beta.mono.double\n\n\n### System information\n\nMac OS Tahoe / Windows 11 \n\n### Issue description\n\nAttached are two images and two videos, one video that shows the behavior in godot, and one video that shows the default behavior in unity (and the desired behavior.)\n\nWe have two animations, a walk cycle, with 30 frames, and a jog cycle, with 24 frames. These animations should blend together fine, as the pacing is the same if you look at them with normalized time, which godot does not, despite having the \"Sync\" checkbox enabled on the BlendSpace.\n\nGodot seems to shorten the longest clip, in this case the walk cycle, which causes the walk to speed up drastically, and it still does not fix the \"stumbling\" in the 0.5 blend of the animations.\n\n<img width=\"1208\" height=\"698\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84976cbc-5add-4de9-b8f2-370afd0f636a\" />\n\n<img width=\"1292\" height=\"696\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1dbbee51-bb39-4f29-a00b-b6331cc7ee95\" />\n\nIncorrect behavior from Godot\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a1fbc53-6fa0-471a-a6c6-93e635e77aee\n\nExpected behavior in Unity\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9cf96d9-2fe4-47e8-8958-1b5d8cef4215\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- create 2 animations at 30 fps, one with 24 frames and one with 30\n- add them to a blend space\n- check the \"sync\" box\n- one gets sped up, and they're still not synced.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109968/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}